61	 * Tokenizes a single command line into shell-style words, honoring
62	 * double-quoted segments (`--description "some text"` -> one token
63	 * `some text`) and `\"` escapes within a quoted segment.
64	 *
65	 * Exported for reuse by the parity test and for direct unit testing of
66	 * quoting edge cases.
67	 */
